@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #34495E
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "liblevenshtein\nstructural dictionary DFS" as L #FADBD8
rectangle "duallity\nFuzzyMatchV2 DP + bound" as D #D6EAF8
rectangle "lling-llang\nArcticWeight + WFST" as A #FCF3CF
database "libdictenstein\nDAWG / trie" as T #D5F5E3
rectangle "top-k candidates" as O #E8DAEF

T --> L : dictionary edges
L --> D : balanced enter / leave
D --> L : keep subtree?\n<latex>U(p) \geq \tau_k</latex>
D --> A : arc delta\n<latex>S_{j+1}-S_j</latex>
D --> O : exact score
A --> O : accepting path weight

note bottom of L
min-plus distance remains here
when non-negative extension gives
<latex>c \leq c \otimes w</latex>
end note
note bottom of D
max-plus gain requires an explicit
upper bound with the unstarted term
end note
@enduml
